LWeb browsers for CyborgOS 320K. This is a local page, HOME.8BM - a file, like
LAmigaGuide's: its links go to other files on this drive, or to the web.
L
LG (or the Go to tool) types an address: http://host/path?parameters, or a file
L- A:NAME.8BM, NAME.8BM.
